{"id":150,"flavor":[{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Its DNA is almost the same as Mew’s. However, its size and disposition are vastly different."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Mewtwo is a Pokémon that was created by genetic manipulation. However, even though the scientific power of humans created this Pokémon’s body, they failed to endow Mewtwo with a compassionate heart."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"A Pokémon created by recombining Mew’s genes. It’s said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"It was created by a scientist after years of horrific gene-splicing and DNA-engineering experiments."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It usually remains motionless to conserve energy, so that it may unleash its full power in battle."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Because its battle abilities were raised to the ultimate level, it thinks only of defeating its foes."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"A POKéMON whose genetic code was repeatedly recombined for research. It turned vicious as a result."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A POKéMON that was created by genetic manipulation. However, even though the scientific power of humans made its body, they failed to give it a warm heart."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Said to rest quietly in an undiscovered cave, this POKéMON was created solely for battling."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Pressure","hidden":false,"description":"Puts other Pokémon under pressure, causing them to expend more PP to use their moves."},{"name":"Unnerve","hidden":true,"description":"Unnerves opposing Pokémon and makes them unable to eat Berries."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":0,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"rare","color":"Purple","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":150,"name":"Mewtwo","condition":null,"childre